KNOWN ISSUES

- master.css declares "FORUM JOURNEY -- CONTACT" twice, at two different points
  in the file. The later block wins. Anyone editing the first one will see no
  effect. Not yet reconciled.
- A previously hosted helper script,
  https://arnold-blip.github.io/lm-scripts/forum-journey-prepare.js, used to run
  the Things To Do card and has been REMOVED from the HTML block. It is
  superseded by master.js and actively fought it -- it hid the pill, stripped
  the card's href, and overwrote the merged link with a stale constant URL. Do
  not re-add it. The `?v=1` and `?v=2` URLs are the same file; the query string
  is only a cache-buster.
- The Member Portal home page renders these same three cards with a different
  completed treatment (original copy struck through, white pill, action hidden).
  This build replaces the copy instead and uses a green pill. The two are
  intentionally different; they are not yet a shared component.
